# Project stack

Frontend-only React app for EVE Online manufacturing planning. No backend server in this repo.

## Stack

| Layer | Choice |
|---|---|
| Runtime / PM | Node, pnpm |
| Build | Vite 8, TypeScript 5 |
| UI | React 19, Tailwind, DaisyUI |
| State | Zustand (`src/stores/`) |
| Async data | TanStack Query (`src/services/`) |
| Routing | React Router (`src/pages/<Name>/`) |
| Tests | Vitest |

## Key directories

| Path | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `src/pages/<Name>/` | Route pages; colocate UI used by that route only |
| `src/lib/` | Pure game/business logic (cost, plan, ranking) |
| `src/components/layout/` | Shared chrome (`Layout`, `PageHeader`) |
| `src/components/` | Shared widgets |
| `src/hooks/` | React hooks |
| `src/services/` | ESI/market fetch, auth, sync, cache |
| `src/types/` | Shared TypeScript types |
| `public/data/` | Generated SDE JSON (do not hand-edit) |
| `scripts/` | Data rebuild scripts (`fetch-data`, catalog) |

## Data boundaries

- **Static game data:** `public/data/` from `pnpm run fetch-data`
- **Live prices:** ESI/Fuzzwork via `src/services/market/`
- **User data:** localStorage + optional Google Drive sync
- **Domain rules:** `eve-industry-domain.mdc` and `src/lib/cost.ts`

## UI conventions

- Folders: `src-layout.mdc` (no `src/features/`, no barrels)
- Layout: `css-layout.mdc`
- Shared shells: `component-primitives.mdc`
- Components: `react-component-conventions.mdc`

## Agent communication

- เมื่อเสนอตัวเลือกหลายทาง: `choice-explanations-th.mdc` (อธิบายแต่ละทางเป็นภาษาไทย + ตัวอย่าง)

## Out of scope for this repo

- NestJS/backend APIs, SQL migrations, Jira/Notion workflows
- Server-side rendering (SPA only)
